    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Barry Auctioneers & Valuers are delighted to present to the market this impressive three-bedroom mid-terraced property, ideally located in the popular and well-established area of Farranree on Cork’s northside.\r\n\r\nThe property is presented in good condition throughout and offers well-proportioned accommodation, making it an excellent opportunity for first-time buyers, investors, or those seeking a comfortable family home.\r\n\r\nConveniently situated close to a wide range of essential local amenities, including shops, schools, public transport links and recreational facilities, the property also benefits from easy access to Cork City centre and surrounding areas.\r\n\r\nEarly viewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate all this property has to offer."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Entrance hallway - 3.2m x 1.95m \r\n\r\n\r\nLiving Room - 4.72m x 2.75m \r\n\r\n\r\nKitchen - 4.67m x 3.25m \r\nFully fitted kitchen with all integrated appliances\nwalls and floors tastefully tiled\r\n\r\nDownstairs shower room - 1.56m x 1.55m \r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 4.83m x 2.9m \r\nlaminated flooring \nbuilt in unit\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 3.67m x 2.58m \r\nlaminated flooring \nbuilt in unit\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 2.7m x 2.14m \r\nlaminated flooring \nbuilt in unit\r\n\r\nBathroom - 1.98m x 1.5m \r\nTastefully tiled\n\r\n\r\nGarden - \r\nLarge back garden\r\n\r\n"
      },
